      "steps": [
        "直線改寫成 $x=y+2$。交點：$y^2=y+2$，$y^2-y-2=(y-2)(y+1)=0$，$y=-1$ 或 2。",
        "代 $y=0$：直線 $x=2$，拋物線 $x=0$，直線在右邊。",
        "$A=\\int_{-1}^2((y+2)-y^2)\\,dy=\\left[\\frac{y^2}{2}+2y-\\frac{y^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^2=\\left(2+4-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-2+\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{10}{3}+\\frac{7}{6}=\\frac{9}{2}$。",
        "對照直切：$\\int_0^1 2\\sqrt{x}\\,dx+\\int_1^4(\\sqrt{x}-x+2)\\,dx=\\frac{4}{3}+\\frac{19}{6}=\\frac{9}{2}$，答案一樣，但要拆兩段。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{9}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(y+2-y^2, -1, 2) == 9/2 ;; INT(2*sqrt(x), 0, 1) + INT(sqrt(x)-x+2, 1, 4) == 9/2"
    },
